## Python projects: computer vision and speech processing

My Python work includes practical computer vision, machine learning, and audio-analysis projects:

- [face_detection_and_embading_in_python_with_webcam](https://github.com/sunn789/face_detection_and_embading_in_python_with_webcam) — real-time webcam face detection with OpenCV and MediaPipe, including facial landmarks for the eyes, nose, mouth, and ears
- [Face_detect_in_deeplearning](https://github.com/sunn789/Face_detect_in_deeplearning) — real-time and image-based face detection using MediaPipe Tasks, BlazeFace/TFLite, OpenCV, and CPU-optimized inference
- [noise_analyze_practice_4](https://github.com/sunn789/noise_analyze_practice_4) — speech-feature robustness analysis using MFCC, LPC, PLP, PLP-Rasta, noise generation, spectral subtraction, and Wiener filtering
